; A performance fixture: it moves one variable, the NoiseTexture2D build size, to 4096x4096
; seamless, 16 times the pixels of a 1024x1024 field that takes about a second on the main
; thread. The e2e long-task gate opens it and requires no main-thread task over 50 ms while the
; texture builds and uploads. No golden covers it: unit-noisetexture2d already pins the pixels.

